        <actionButtonLabel>What&apos;s New</actionButtonLabel>
        <actionButtonLink>https://salescrm.intel.com/ww50-2022-release-update/</actionButtonLink>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;A new Bulk actions capability has been added to IQR.&amp;nbsp;The following enhancements are now available:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bulk SDM Approval/Rejection&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bulk Update of AE or SDM&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bulk Deal Creation for RPMs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more information please click &lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/ww50-2022-release-update/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <delayDays>1</delayDays>
